If `link_string_in` is an empty string, then `js_linkstring` has `s_data = ""` (global). Then `_dwarf_pathjoinl(out, &joind.js_linkstring)` is called with `inputs = ""`. Then `is_full_path(inputs, joinchar)` reads `inputs[1]` which is past the 1-byte global buffer `""`.

